Gemini solved the bare `easy` instance, so the harness correctly escalated to `medium` (`n=29`, 216 compact-route operations, \(2^{29}\) vertices). The first two easy failures remain useful diagnostics, but `easy` cannot ship.
diff --git a/gen_2408_03727.py b/gen_2408_03727.py
