+        "",
+        "The binary-reflected Gray word is gray(i)=i XOR floor(i/2).  For j=0,1,",
+        "define the cyclic order O_j(i), for i=0,...,|V|-1, by starting from",
+        "gray(i), applying ROUND_j exactly E_j times, and applying OUTER once.",
